  "title": "PMCC long leg: buy 95 delta or higher, not 70 delta",
  "summary": "A poor man's covered call with a 70 delta long call and a 45 delta short call is net long only 25 delta and is really a short gamma trade. In a rally the short call reaches 100 delta fast while the long call lags, so on day one the position can go net short. A 95 delta or higher long call avoids this and beats the 70 delta version in all cases except an extreme sell-off.",
